  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Storms — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>At 11th level, you have learned to greatly amplify your storms. As an action for 10 cursed energy, you fill a 100 ft diameter sphere within 300 ft that you can see with a thick storm for 1 minute. The sphere is considered difficult terrain and heavily obscured to all creatures other than you. In addition to the effects of <em>Storm Creation</em>, all creatures other than you that start their turn within range take 3d10 lightning damage. When you take the Attack action, you can spend 2 cursed energy to replace one of your attacks with a use of <em>Lightning</em>, targeting a creature within the storm sphere with a ranged cursed energy attack even if you can’t see them.</p>",
